{"title":"1995 OIM Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> be an integer greater than 1. Find the real numbers\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/0/530214224c75e061c9028e3220be41cd44cb3739.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[X_1, X_2, \\cdots ,X_n \\ge 1,\\;\\text{and}\\; X_{n+1} &gt; 0\\]\" width=\"272\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>that verify the following two conditions:\n</p><p>a. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/9/1e9c014429c73300980c29d8c16f5339630bda7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_1^{1/2} + X_2^{3/2} + \\cdots + X_n^{n+1/2} = n.X_{n+1}^{1/2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"301\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>b. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/f/d8f6677656868938fd4d12f8b2f833618bcaeb7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(X_1 + X_2 + \\cdots + X_n)/n = X_{n+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"258\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1995_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe10.htm\">https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe10.htm</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017183316\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 36/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 423/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 821/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.911      1 Template:Solution\n100.00%    5.911      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26096:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017183316 and revision id 207071. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}